Z||000006||terryk||09-06-2001||10:05 PM||||I used to think the shock was to dampen engine resonance, but now I'm convinced it's to dampen out the jolt from the A/C compressor coming on. I think it's needed since the torque strap is pushed rather than pulled so it's not as effective.||||reg||1
